			description: [
				"要更改 &2multifarm&r 种植和收获的内容，需要修改其配置。新建农场默认为 &aArboretum&r，这是一种受管理的农场类型。"
				""
				"要重新配置农场，玩家需要一个&1焊烙铁&r、一个&b电路板&r（最好是复杂电路板，以便配置农场的四个侧面）以及用于创建特定农场类型的&e电子管&r之一。"
				""
				"&nRight-click&r on the farm while holding the &1Soldering Iron&r. Make sure the Type Selection at the top of the GUI is changed to be either \"Managed Farms\" or \"Manual Farms\" and put the &bCircuit Board&r into the top right slot. Choose an &eElectron Tube&r from the tables below and place into the slot which corresponds to the side of the farm to be configured into that farm type."
